        "Nebula, Echo, Lazer, Rasp and Streak each offer their own distinctive colour or light effect, while Snovlox and Plexus lean into textured black and white looks. The 460nm and 600nm films apply an infrared-style colour shift, available in both 35mm and 120 format, and Paper mimics the texture of aged photographic paper.",
